### Health check
GET http://localhost:3001/api/health

### All quotes
GET http://localhost:3001/api/quotes

### Filter by author
GET http://localhost:3001/api/quotes?author=kent

### One quote
GET http://localhost:3001/api/quotes/q1

### Unknown quote (404)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/quotes/nope

### Create a quote (201)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Talk is cheap. Show me the code.",
  "author": "Linus Torvalds"
}

### Create without text (400)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/quotes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "author": "Nobody"
}

### Replace a quote
PUT http://localhost:3001/api/quotes/q1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "Programs must be written for people to read, and only incidentally for machines to execute.",
  "author": "Harold Abelson"
}

### Delete a quote (204)
DELETE http://localhost:3001/api/quotes/q3

### Unknown route (404)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/nope
